	"changelog": "\n- Fixed: signing in failed with \"redirect_uri: Not matching configuration\", and had to be finished within 10 seconds.\n- New: a Sign-in port setting, and the Redirect URI for your own Client ID shown in the settings.\n- Search: Ctrl+1 to Ctrl+6 and Ctrl+Tab switch the type and search again; Ctrl+F returns to the search field.\n- Artist window: opens on Top Tracks, with a new Playlists found by name tab.\n- Every list has the same context menu, Enter and row format; long lists load a page at a time.\n- Every shortcut inside the windows can be changed (Window Shortcuts... in the settings), and there are new settings.\n- Many bug fixes; see the changelog for the full list.\n\t",
	"licenseURL": "https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html",
	"submissionTime": 1794086519000,
	"translations": [
		{
			"language": "id",
			"displayName": "Accessify Play",
			"description": "Accessify Play memberikan kontrol NVDA komprehensif untuk pemutaran Spotify di perangkat apa pun yang mendukung Spotify Connect. Langganan Spotify Premium diperlukan untuk fungsionalitas penuh.",
			"changelog": "\n- Diperbaiki: proses masuk gagal dengan \"redirect_uri: Not matching configuration\", dan harus selesai dalam 10 detik.\n- Baru: pengaturan port masuk, dan Redirect URI untuk Client ID sendiri ditampilkan di pengaturan.\n- Pencarian: Ctrl+1 sampai Ctrl+6 dan Ctrl+Tab mengganti jenis dan langsung mencari lagi; Ctrl+F kembali ke kolom pencarian.\n- Jendela artis: terbuka di Top Tracks, dengan tab baru Daftar Putar berdasarkan nama.\n- Setiap daftar punya menu konteks, Enter, dan format baris yang sama; daftar panjang dimuat per halaman.\n- Setiap pintasan di dalam jendela bisa diubah (Window Shortcuts... di pengaturan), dan ada pengaturan baru.\n- Banyak perbaikan bug; lihat changelog untuk daftar lengkapnya.\n\t"
		},
		{
			"language": "en",
			"displayName": "Accessify Play",
			"description": "Accessify Play provides comprehensive NVDA control for Spotify playback on any Connect-enabled device. A Spotify Premium subscription is required for full functionality.",
			"changelog": "\n- Fixed: signing in failed with \"redirect_uri: Not matching configuration\", and had to be finished within 10 seconds.\n- New: a Sign-in port setting, and the Redirect URI for your own Client ID shown in the settings.\n- Search: Ctrl+1 to Ctrl+6 and Ctrl+Tab switch the type and search again; Ctrl+F returns to the search field.\n- Artist window: opens on Top Tracks, with a new Playlists found by name tab.\n- Every list has the same context menu, Enter and row format; long lists load a page at a time.\n- Every shortcut inside the windows can be changed (Window Shortcuts... in the settings), and there are new settings.\n- Many bug fixes; see the changelog for the full list.\n\t"
		}
	],
